# Recorded input for the range slider page (widgets/range.zig, `Page`), at 320 x 120 in the
# default theme: the Frequency track (20..200, at 60 and 140) at x 12..308, y 38..46. One line
# per frame below (format: input.Replay). Scancodes: Right 79, Home 74, End 77.
# 0: rest: 60 to 140
frame
viewport 320 120
dt 0.016
pointer 300 110
# 1: press at a quarter, in the low thumb's half: low 65
frame
pointer 86 42
buttons left
# 2: drag to the middle: low 110
frame
pointer 160 42
# 3: release
frame
buttons
# 4: Right on the focused low thumb: 111.8
frame
press 79
# 5: press at three quarters, in the high thumb's half: high 155
frame
pointer 234 42
buttons left
# 6: release, then End: high 200
frame
buttons
press 77
# 7: Home on the high thumb: down to the low one, 111.8
frame
press 74
